WEBVTT

00:00:00.146 --> 00:00:03.691
EARTHDOOM PROPHECY
COUNTERMEASURE MEETING

00:00:04.067 --> 00:00:05.735
That's what's going on here?

00:00:05.985 --> 00:00:08.029
We're asking criminals for help?

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:10.615
Has the Association approved this?

00:00:11.282 --> 00:00:12.242
It has!

00:00:12.492 --> 00:00:15.286
Right now,
a crisis has begun for mankind

00:00:15.412 --> 00:00:18.206
that we cannot overcome
unless we unite as one.

00:00:18.331 --> 00:00:19.707
Our current heroes:

00:00:19.874 --> 00:00:21.543
390 Class C's,

00:00:21.709 --> 00:00:22.961
101 Class B's,

00:00:23.086 --> 00:00:24.671
38 Class A's,

00:00:24.754 --> 00:00:26.089
and 17 from Class S

00:00:26.381 --> 00:00:27.924
are clearly not enough!

00:00:28.258 --> 00:00:29.592
No one expects you
to work for free.

00:00:29.717 --> 00:00:31.636
We will duly compensate you...

00:00:31.803 --> 00:00:33.930
for every monster you defeat!

00:00:34.097 --> 00:00:36.266
What a crock! That's a complete
waste of cash.

00:00:36.516 --> 00:00:40.270
You can't count on trash like this
when things go south.

00:00:41.855 --> 00:00:43.523
And you're so high and mighty?

00:00:43.982 --> 00:00:46.443
I've killed more people
than you've met.

00:00:46.818 --> 00:00:47.527
Wanna try me?

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:48.778
These wimps...

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:52.449
...Nave no heart!

00:00:53.616 --> 00:00:54.909
B-But—

00:00:55.034 --> 00:00:58.204
Well now, look at this!

00:00:58.455 --> 00:01:01.040
She's good—her prophecy's spot on.

00:01:01.458 --> 00:01:05.420
She knew a God-level threat like
no one had ever seen was coming.

00:01:05.753 --> 00:01:07.464
That old meathead's right.

00:01:07.839 --> 00:01:11.426
All these nobodies put together
couldn't take me down.

00:01:11.634 --> 00:01:12.594
Hah?

00:01:12.719 --> 00:01:13.970
Who are you?

00:01:14.137 --> 00:01:15.430
Name's Garou.

00:01:15.847 --> 00:01:17.724
I've busted tons of
martial arts dojos

00:01:17.932 --> 00:01:20.560
and you could say
I've got a thing for monsters.

00:01:21.019 --> 00:01:22.270
Now what's the hold up?

00:01:22.645 --> 00:01:24.647
All of you, come at me.

00:01:25.315 --> 00:01:27.484
Let's find out who's strongest.

00:01:27.817 --> 00:01:30.153
You see, that's what I came for!

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:31.779
Stop this foolishness.

00:01:31.946 --> 00:01:32.906
Foolishness?

00:01:32.989 --> 00:01:34.616
We don't need you. Get lost.

00:01:34.782 --> 00:01:38.578
That how you treat a guest,
Mister Big Shot of Justice?

00:01:38.995 --> 00:01:40.538
Hell, you've made up my mind.

00:01:40.663 --> 00:01:44.918
To each and every coward here,
I'm gonna mete out some evil.

00:01:45.502 --> 00:01:47.045
A little slaughter party!

00:01:47.212 --> 00:01:49.422
You three, there's a job for you.

00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:51.549
Toss him out.

00:01:51.758 --> 00:01:52.717
With pleasure.

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:08.024
Well, gramps? You forget to put
some "heart" behind your punch?

00:02:08.691 --> 00:02:11.027
With or without that bullcrap,
the strong...

00:02:11.361 --> 00:02:12.779
...are strong!

00:02:13.488 --> 00:02:14.531
Old fart!

00:02:17.575 --> 00:02:19.202
Whoa! Not bad!

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:21.204
Yeah! That's how you do it!

00:02:21.287 --> 00:02:22.247
Huh?

00:02:22.539 --> 00:02:24.958
What're you worms cheering about?

00:02:25.166 --> 00:02:26.459
You're gonna die, too.

00:02:26.584 --> 00:02:27.835
What'd he say?!

00:02:27.961 --> 00:02:30.213
You're supposed to be on our side!

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:31.422
No!

00:02:31.631 --> 00:02:33.383
Heroes are always late to the party

00:02:33.508 --> 00:02:35.134
while monsters take the initiative.

00:02:35.385 --> 00:02:38.054
They appear suddenly,
out of the blue.

00:02:38.221 --> 00:02:40.640
Listen up.
You're on the humans' side.

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:43.059
I'm with the monsters.

00:02:43.768 --> 00:02:46.062
A human calling himself a monster?

00:02:46.229 --> 00:02:47.564
Foolish scum!

00:02:47.897 --> 00:02:49.732
I'll burn your body to ash!

00:02:57.907 --> 00:03:00.076
These little tricks
liven things up,

00:03:00.326 --> 00:03:02.412
but once you see through 'em,
they're ugly.

00:03:02.829 --> 00:03:03.788
He just.../

00:03:03.913 --> 00:03:06.833
This is central tower,
7th-floor multipurpose hall!

00:03:07.709 --> 00:03:10.712
Send every hero
in the facility, stat!

00:03:11.004 --> 00:03:11.754
All of them!

00:03:15.633 --> 00:03:20.930
Taking on several Class S at once
might be a bit much right now.

00:03:21.264 --> 00:03:25.101
Well, that should be enough for
"Garou the Monster's"

00:03:25.768 --> 00:03:27.270
spectacular debut.

00:03:27.895 --> 00:03:30.023
Today was my declaration of war.

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:33.067
In six months,
I'll be even stronger.

00:03:33.443 --> 00:03:35.862
Then, I come back in
through the front door.

00:03:36.904 --> 00:03:38.281
Till then...

00:03:54.547 --> 00:03:56.591
Through the once tranquil town

00:03:56.674 --> 00:03:58.926
A thunderous roar peals forth

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:02.930
Watch out! Freak out! Monsters!

00:04:03.806 --> 00:04:05.892
Who is going to take the lead

00:04:05.975 --> 00:04:08.436
When we destroy the evil ones?

00:04:08.603 --> 00:04:13.358
Destruction, contusion...
Loosen up!

00:04:13.483 --> 00:04:15.401
We know, We are...

00:04:15.485 --> 00:04:18.154
HEROES!

00:04:18.237 --> 00:04:19.864
Why were you

00:04:19.989 --> 00:04:22.158
born of evil?

00:04:22.283 --> 00:04:24.243
If you wish to know

00:04:24.369 --> 00:04:26.663
I shall tell!

00:04:26.746 --> 00:04:32.627
This night the punching fist
of glorious justice

00:04:32.794 --> 00:04:36.130
Will shatter your fate apart!

00:04:37.423 --> 00:04:42.011
That word exists for you
and you alone

00:04:42.136 --> 00:04:46.683
Raise your silent fist
to the sky!

00:04:46.808 --> 00:04:51.354
The apostle bears
the weight of solitude

00:04:51.479 --> 00:04:57.485
For a peace not filled
with hatred

00:04:57.568 --> 00:05:00.947
He must fight!

00:05:11.791 --> 00:05:12.959
Orders understood?

00:05:13.042 --> 00:05:15.545
— Yes!
— Yes!

00:05:16.045 --> 00:05:19.298
And if the target shows
the slightest resistance?

00:05:19.882 --> 00:05:22.051
We physically punish him
to the point that

00:05:22.176 --> 00:05:23.720
he never behaves brashly again!

00:05:24.011 --> 00:05:24.971
Very good.

00:05:25.263 --> 00:05:27.223
— Thank you, Miss Blizzard!
— Thank you, Miss Blizzard!

00:05:28.015 --> 00:05:33.646
THE HUMAN MONSTER

00:05:33.730 --> 00:05:35.064
to Class S, Rank 14.

00:05:35.732 --> 00:05:39.277
All I did was defeat monsters
I bumped into.

00:05:39.819 --> 00:05:40.778
I've gone up that much?

00:05:40.945 --> 00:05:44.073
It is because nowadays,
monsters appear almost daily.

00:05:44.699 --> 00:05:48.202
You defeat monsters, but do not
report it to the Association.

00:05:48.661 --> 00:05:51.748
The fact that your rank is
increasing despite that

00:05:52.081 --> 00:05:55.460
means witnesses are reporting
your work for you.

00:05:56.002 --> 00:05:58.171
In other words,
your identity as a hero

00:05:58.337 --> 00:06:01.090
is gradually becoming known
to the citizenry, Master.

00:06:01.591 --> 00:06:04.969
Before long, fan clubs for you
might spring up.

00:06:05.595 --> 00:06:06.637
What? No way.

00:06:07.138 --> 00:06:09.557
Even you, a Class S,
don't have a fan club.

00:06:10.767 --> 00:06:12.560
A fan club for me does exist.

00:06:13.478 --> 00:06:14.604
Seriously?

00:06:15.605 --> 00:06:16.898
High-speed object detected!

00:06:17.106 --> 00:06:18.608
That is not human speed.

00:06:19.358 --> 00:06:20.109
A monster?

00:06:20.568 --> 00:06:21.652
Ooh, an item.

00:06:22.069 --> 00:06:24.280
Master appears preoccupied.

00:06:25.072 --> 00:06:26.032
Guess I will go...

00:06:28.576 --> 00:06:31.329
I will be able to test out
my new upgrades.

00:06:31.788 --> 00:06:32.371
Show yourself!

00:06:34.457 --> 00:06:35.500
A human?

00:06:35.792 --> 00:06:36.876
What do you want?

00:06:37.126 --> 00:06:38.252
Get Saitama out here.

00:06:38.628 --> 00:06:41.506
I obtained information
saying he lives here.

00:06:41.798 --> 00:06:43.591
Are you a friend
of Master Saitama's?

00:06:43.716 --> 00:06:45.718
We've met somewhere before...

00:06:46.135 --> 00:06:49.555
I am Speed-o'-Sound Sonic,
Saitama's rival.

00:06:49.972 --> 00:06:51.641
Today is the day
I settle the score.

00:06:51.808 --> 00:06:52.934
Now, out of my way.

00:06:53.017 --> 00:06:54.685
Speed-o'-Sound Sonic!

00:06:54.936 --> 00:06:57.188
So it's you, the pervert.

00:06:58.064 --> 00:07:01.651
You dare call yourself
Master's rival? Shameless!

00:07:01.943 --> 00:07:04.070
One more step and
you will be eliminated.

00:07:05.071 --> 00:07:07.532
Always trailing Saitama around
like shit on a goldfish...

00:07:07.657 --> 00:07:09.033
You will be "eliminated."

00:07:11.035 --> 00:07:15.623
Oh crap. I overwrote
King's saved data.

00:07:16.332 --> 00:07:18.167
And after I brought it home
without asking...

00:07:18.876 --> 00:07:20.044
It'll probably be fine.

00:07:20.503 --> 00:07:21.587
No, it won't.

00:07:22.839 --> 00:07:23.422
Aw man.

00:07:26.676 --> 00:07:29.095
Class B, Rank 7 hero Saitama!

00:07:29.178 --> 00:07:30.179
Come out here!

00:07:30.429 --> 00:07:34.183
Class B, Rank 1 Hellish Blizzard
would like a word.

00:07:35.518 --> 00:07:38.020
Oh, I've already got a subscription
to the newspaper.

00:07:38.104 --> 00:07:40.189
We are not salesmen!

00:07:40.273 --> 00:07:42.650
We're heroes who outrank you!

00:07:43.067 --> 00:07:46.070
How do you do, new hero Saitama.

00:07:46.571 --> 00:07:48.656
I am Hellish Blizzard...

00:07:48.865 --> 00:07:50.408
Perhaps you've heard of me?

00:07:50.992 --> 00:07:53.119
Not even once.
Who are you?

00:07:53.327 --> 00:07:55.371
She is the Class B,
Rank 1 hero!

00:07:55.496 --> 00:07:57.874
Oh, I see.
Keep up the good work!

00:07:58.249 --> 00:07:58.875
So?

00:08:01.335 --> 00:08:03.129
Bastard sure 1S COCky...

00:08:03.713 --> 00:08:06.340
I doubt you can take a hint,
so I'll be clear.

00:08:06.716 --> 00:08:10.553
All who ascend to Class B
first pay their respects to Hellish Blizzard.

00:08:10.636 --> 00:08:11.721
It's the custom.

00:08:11.971 --> 00:08:13.097
Pay respects?

00:08:16.767 --> 00:08:19.186
Yo. lam Saitama.

00:08:19.270 --> 00:08:20.313
Howja do?

00:08:22.231 --> 00:08:23.232
Well, that'll do.

00:08:24.066 --> 00:08:26.402
Now, are you aware that
there are various factions

00:08:26.527 --> 00:08:27.862
in the hero business?

00:08:28.029 --> 00:08:29.071
Factions?

00:08:29.572 --> 00:08:32.408
In this industry,
if you aren't part of a group,

00:08:32.575 --> 00:08:34.076
you don't survive.

00:08:34.201 --> 00:08:35.244
I don't get it.

00:08:35.661 --> 00:08:38.331
I'm saying it's impossible
to raise your rank alone.

00:08:38.414 --> 00:08:38.956
Why not?

00:08:39.081 --> 00:08:40.249
Obstacles in your way.

00:08:40.541 --> 00:08:41.417
Like what?

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:42.752
Like rivals.

00:08:42.835 --> 00:08:44.462
I don't really understand...

00:08:44.754 --> 00:08:46.130
But anyway, I'm kinda busy—

00:08:46.255 --> 00:08:47.840
I'm not done talking!

00:08:48.925 --> 00:08:51.052
Align yourself with me.

00:08:51.802 --> 00:08:55.056
If you do, I'll ensure you never
drop out of the top of Class B.

00:08:57.016 --> 00:08:57.850
Huh?

00:08:58.643 --> 00:08:59.602
An!

00:09:00.227 --> 00:09:01.437
What you're saying is,

00:09:01.562 --> 00:09:04.440
if I refuse,
you'll stand in my way?

00:09:04.690 --> 00:09:08.110
Do you make threats like this
to every Class B?

00:09:08.235 --> 00:09:09.320
Like a gang leader?

00:09:09.445 --> 00:09:12.281
I only make offers to heroes
who catch my eye.

00:09:14.283 --> 00:09:16.786
Are you afraid that
I'll take your Rank 1 spot?

00:09:17.286 --> 00:09:18.496
Don't worry about it.

00:09:18.621 --> 00:09:20.581
I'll make Class A soon enough.

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:23.376
Come to think of it, wny haven't
you moved on to Class A?

00:09:23.584 --> 00:09:25.503
Hurry up and give me your answer.

00:09:25.836 --> 00:09:27.713
Obviously the answer is no.

00:09:27.797 --> 00:09:30.257
There shouldn't be a pecking order
among heroes!

00:09:30.466 --> 00:09:31.842
Eyelashes! Wild Monkey!

00:09:32.843 --> 00:09:37.139
Rough him up so bad
he never works as a hero again!

00:09:46.399 --> 00:09:48.317
You won't survive like this,

00:09:49.402 --> 00:09:50.486
Blizzard.

00:09:51.362 --> 00:09:55.157
So you're trying to push me aside.

00:10:03.082 --> 00:10:04.041
Is this...

00:10:05.251 --> 00:10:06.502
...telekinesis?

00:10:06.752 --> 00:10:08.170
Exactly.

00:10:08.295 --> 00:10:09.964
You don't seem surprised.

00:10:10.172 --> 00:10:12.842
Are you gonna fight me
with rocks and stuff?

00:10:13.009 --> 00:10:13.676
Better not.

00:10:14.010 --> 00:10:15.344
Think you can mock me?

00:10:16.095 --> 00:10:17.138
You'll regret it.

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:19.724
I'll kill you so bad,
you won't be able to die.

00:10:20.349 --> 00:10:21.892
Hellstorm!

00:10:28.441 --> 00:10:30.401
Flesh peels away,
bones crack and rupture...

00:10:30.526 --> 00:10:33.738
The cruelty and brutality
break your will in an instant.

00:10:34.113 --> 00:10:35.573
It's your own doing, though.

00:10:35.906 --> 00:10:38.075
You deserve it for thinking
you can surpass me!

00:10:38.576 --> 00:10:40.119
No one Is better than me!

00:10:40.703 --> 00:10:41.829
All my enemies—

00:10:41.912 --> 00:10:44.582
You're too sensitive
for the top rank.

00:10:44.915 --> 00:10:45.624
... Will be crushed!

00:10:46.417 --> 00:10:48.377
You don't get what it means
to be a hero.

00:10:49.295 --> 00:10:52.757
The world is full of
super-strong, bad people.

00:10:53.549 --> 00:10:55.551
Standing up to them
is what heroes do.

00:10:56.552 --> 00:10:58.387
Even if you've gotta do it alone.

00:10:58.763 --> 00:11:01.098
Someone like you, who gathers
the weak to herself

00:11:01.265 --> 00:11:03.601
so she can feel strong,
can't understand.

00:11:03.726 --> 00:11:05.269
It'll come back to hurt you.

00:11:05.519 --> 00:11:06.395
Factions?

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:07.563
Newb crushing?

00:11:07.646 --> 00:11:08.773
Rankings?

00:11:09.231 --> 00:11:10.399
Who'd care about them?!

00:11:11.275 --> 00:11:13.611
Show heroes some respect,
poser!

00:11:13.736 --> 00:11:17.156
Shut up! What would you
know about /7e?!

00:11:47.061 --> 00:11:49.396
What... happened?

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:50.439
Oww!

00:11:50.856 --> 00:11:52.775
My hunt for a rat...

00:11:54.193 --> 00:11:57.029
...Nas lead me back to
Master's apartment.

00:11:58.030 --> 00:11:59.907
That's Genos, a Class S...

00:12:00.032 --> 00:12:01.367
What's he doing here?

00:12:02.034 --> 00:12:06.122
Master Saitama, I apologize
for kicking up dust near your home.

00:12:06.914 --> 00:12:09.583
This is a little more than "dust"!

00:12:11.252 --> 00:12:13.420
I caught a glimpse of Sonic
just now.

00:12:13.587 --> 00:12:15.089
What were the two of you doing?

00:12:16.173 --> 00:12:18.259
You have connections
with Class S heroes?

00:12:18.342 --> 00:12:20.261
Huh? You mean Genos?

00:12:20.553 --> 00:12:22.638
I am Master Saitama's disciple.

00:12:22.888 --> 00:12:26.016
Disciple?
A Class S, to a Class B?

00:12:26.809 --> 00:12:30.146
You are Class B, Rank 1
Hellish Blizzard.

00:12:30.271 --> 00:12:31.272
I see.

00:12:31.814 --> 00:12:35.651
You have targeted Master Saitama
as your latest newcomer to "crush."

00:12:36.277 --> 00:12:40.322
And now, you are near death
from fighting him, correct?

00:12:40.698 --> 00:12:44.535
No, she got caught up
in your attack.

00:12:44.743 --> 00:12:46.453
Is that so?
Then I apologize—

00:12:46.537 --> 00:12:47.913
Exploding Shuriken!

00:12:50.249 --> 00:12:52.126
— A monster?!
— Not really.

00:12:52.543 --> 00:12:55.004
I'm busy, so get on home.

00:12:56.255 --> 00:12:59.425
You could throw 100 more
and I would still be unscathed.

00:12:59.508 --> 00:13:02.469
Tough talk, but you
haven't even Ait me,

00:13:02.595 --> 00:13:03.137
Puppet-man.

00:13:06.849 --> 00:13:07.766
Saitama!

00:13:07.850 --> 00:13:09.226
Watch me!

00:13:09.351 --> 00:13:11.645
After I turn your disciple
into scrap, you're next!

00:13:12.271 --> 00:13:13.856
Such intense malice...

00:13:14.231 --> 00:13:15.900
And even just standing there,

00:13:16.025 --> 00:13:18.194
I sense his extraordinary
combat abiltty...

00:13:19.069 --> 00:13:20.362
This man is dangerous!

00:13:20.696 --> 00:13:23.699
Master, this stalker's persistence
is an affront.

00:13:23.866 --> 00:13:26.952
I will rid the world
of his existence.

00:13:28.204 --> 00:13:30.539
No way a slug like you
could get rid of me.

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:34.043
Sure you still want to fight me
when that's all you've got?

00:13:34.293 --> 00:13:36.879
When did I show you
all I have got?

00:13:37.004 --> 00:13:38.380
You lose, fool.

00:13:54.104 --> 00:13:55.064
Accelerate.

00:13:57.316 --> 00:14:00.819
He's gotten sort of faster
since we sparred.

00:14:02.863 --> 00:14:03.906
Maybe he got an upgrade?

00:14:04.907 --> 00:14:06.408
/cant see a thing.

00:14:15.376 --> 00:14:17.503
Why does he bother
going around behind me?

00:14:18.087 --> 00:14:20.965
Does this child think
he's faster than me?

00:14:24.426 --> 00:14:26.887
I picked some lint from your hair.

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:30.683
You little—!

00:14:30.933 --> 00:14:33.352
Dropped your guard, did you, Sonic?

00:14:34.228 --> 00:14:35.479
Machinegun Blows!

00:14:37.773 --> 00:14:38.816
He dodged?

00:14:39.441 --> 00:14:40.442
Wait!

00:14:41.235 --> 00:14:42.695
You're hopeless.

00:14:43.195 --> 00:14:46.991
Such confidence, yet your punches
meet only air. How's it feel?

00:14:47.283 --> 00:14:49.493
This master technique
uses special footwork

00:14:49.618 --> 00:14:53.455
and my super-fast movement to
create afterimages. It's called...

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:54.623
Fourfold Funeral!

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:55.457
Now die.

00:14:55.541 --> 00:14:57.084
Scatterflash Slash!

00:14:58.460 --> 00:14:59.586
I cannot follow his movement.

00:15:00.838 --> 00:15:03.132
So I will lay waste
to the entire area!

00:15:03.924 --> 00:15:06.677
Incineration Cannons,
maximum intensity!

00:15:07.678 --> 00:15:08.637
It's over!

00:15:10.556 --> 00:15:11.223
I won?

00:15:11.515 --> 00:15:14.893
No, he dropped
before I slashed him...

00:15:16.812 --> 00:15:17.688
Saitama...

00:15:17.813 --> 00:15:19.565
Trying to save your disciple?

00:15:19.898 --> 00:15:21.191
You're too soft.

00:15:21.317 --> 00:15:24.153
I don't need my whole
neighborhood exploded.

00:15:24.653 --> 00:15:27.031
Besides, the two of you
have no reason to fight.

00:15:27.197 --> 00:15:28.240
Genos...

00:15:28.407 --> 00:15:30.826
Were you built for
petty fights like this?

00:15:31.368 --> 00:15:33.329
And Sonic,
I thought you were after me.

00:15:33.662 --> 00:15:36.332
Since you won't leave it alone,
I'll take you seriously this once.

00:15:39.501 --> 00:15:40.294
Come at me.

00:15:42.254 --> 00:15:44.298
I've been waiting for this moment.

00:15:44.548 --> 00:15:49.136
And to kill you, I've perfected
the ultimate technique!

00:15:49.511 --> 00:15:50.804
Okay, let's see it.

00:15:51.347 --> 00:15:52.848
Ultimate Master Technique!

00:15:53.057 --> 00:15:55.142
Tenfold Funeral!

00:15:56.018 --> 00:15:57.519
Ten clone images?

00:15:58.020 --> 00:16:00.272
Though a joke,
he must have trained hard!

00:16:01.231 --> 00:16:03.984
His combat skills are clearly
Class S level.

00:16:05.235 --> 00:16:07.654
Class B Saitama
doesn't stand a chance.

00:16:08.489 --> 00:16:09.031
Even so...

00:16:09.531 --> 00:16:11.700
Why Is it that when I face you,

00:16:11.784 --> 00:16:14.078
I feel as if !m doomed
to lose every time?

00:16:14.453 --> 00:16:17.039
Until I wipe away this hang up
by beating you,

00:16:17.623 --> 00:16:19.708
I will never break through
my limits!

00:16:19.917 --> 00:16:21.710
Killer Move: Serious Series.

00:16:23.712 --> 00:16:25.172
Serious Sideways Jumps!

00:16:34.556 --> 00:16:36.225
W-What was that?

00:16:36.725 --> 00:16:39.269
I did some sideways jumps,
but went too far.

00:16:39.395 --> 00:16:41.688
He beat me with shock waves...?

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:43.857
My afterimages were meaningless.

00:16:43.982 --> 00:16:45.484
He was faster...

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:48.070
Next time...we...

00:16:48.737 --> 00:16:50.072
Is he dead?

00:16:50.239 --> 00:16:51.615
I wasn't trying to kill him.

00:16:53.242 --> 00:16:54.576
Such power...

00:16:56.995 --> 00:16:58.288
He's not normal.

00:17:01.667 --> 00:17:03.877
I could never make it
to number one.

00:17:04.128 --> 00:17:06.922
I had intelligence,
stamina, street smarts,

00:17:08.257 --> 00:17:10.426
and I was born an esper.

00:17:11.635 --> 00:17:14.638
I should be standing at the top!

00:17:15.431 --> 00:17:17.057
/f only it werent for her...

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:21.937
My older sister and
the world's most powerful esper,

00:17:22.646 --> 00:17:25.023
Tornado.

00:17:25.274 --> 00:17:27.109
Because of her,

00:17:27.234 --> 00:17:31.613
I'd never been number one
in anything my entire life.

00:17:32.656 --> 00:17:35.576
So when I became Class B, Rank 1,
I got to thinking...

00:17:35.909 --> 00:17:37.536
I'd remain in that position

00:17:37.661 --> 00:17:39.788
to control the heroes
of Class B and below

00:17:39.913 --> 00:17:42.249
and surpass my sister,
who only acts independently.

00:17:42.791 --> 00:17:46.670
That little...
Terrible Tornado is Class S.

00:17:47.004 --> 00:17:49.214
Why don't you aim for
Class A, Rank 1?

00:17:49.631 --> 00:17:50.799
Class A is out of the question.

00:17:51.091 --> 00:17:53.844
It'd be no problem
climbing the ranks of Class A,

00:17:54.303 --> 00:17:57.306
but I could never become Rank 1.
Never.

00:17:58.348 --> 00:18:00.142
Class A, Rank 4 Bushi Drill.

00:18:00.642 --> 00:18:02.394
Class A, Rank 3 Okama Itachi.

00:18:02.978 --> 00:18:11.653
Class A, Rank 2 lairon.

00:18:12.154 --> 00:18:18.785
Why not? Because no one can surpass
Class A, Rank 1 Amai Mask.

00:18:19.953 --> 00:18:25.334
The primitive savage found frozen
in an ice floe and revived...

00:18:25.459 --> 00:18:26.502
Suppon.

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:29.505
You escaped from
the research facility

00:18:29.713 --> 00:18:32.841
and accosted those who
tried to help you. You are evil.

00:18:33.008 --> 00:18:36.011
The Association instructed me
to capture you alive,

00:18:36.553 --> 00:18:38.764
but I'm not that merciful.

00:18:38.805 --> 00:18:40.224
CLASS A, RANK 1
HANDSOME KAMEN AMAI MASK

00:18:45.729 --> 00:18:46.772
Enough!

00:18:54.696 --> 00:18:55.989
Amai Mask!

00:18:56.073 --> 00:18:57.366
You're wonderful!

00:18:57.574 --> 00:18:58.992
He's so tough!

00:18:59.493 --> 00:19:03.664
This world is rife with
unimaginable monsters.

00:19:04.331 --> 00:19:06.124
You're quite a monster yourself,

00:19:06.542 --> 00:19:09.002
but not to the level of Amai Mask
or my sister.

00:19:09.378 --> 00:19:12.172
There's also King,
who they call the strongest man,

00:19:12.339 --> 00:19:14.591
and Blast, who stands atop
the hero world.

00:19:14.716 --> 00:19:16.385
They're monsters
even among monsters.

00:19:17.219 --> 00:19:20.806
For us, it's difficult to advance
on our own abilities.

00:19:21.139 --> 00:19:22.849
So what's wrong with
banding together?

00:19:23.809 --> 00:19:25.561
Nothing, really.

00:19:25.852 --> 00:19:28.647
But I don't think I'll become
one of your underlings.

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:30.065
Because you're strong?

00:19:31.066 --> 00:19:33.068
You'll never move up the rankings,
you know.

00:19:33.569 --> 00:19:36.154
Oh well. I tried to get you
into my faction.

00:19:38.073 --> 00:19:40.075
Yo, Saitama!

00:19:41.743 --> 00:19:44.371
Hey, did you take
my game home with you?

00:19:44.663 --> 00:19:46.081
K-King?!

00:19:46.290 --> 00:19:48.250
Sorry, I did take it.

00:19:48.417 --> 00:19:50.586
I knew it. Hand it over.

00:19:50.752 --> 00:19:52.337
No, I'm really sorry.

00:19:52.421 --> 00:19:54.423
No big deal,
as long as you give it back.

00:19:54.881 --> 00:19:55.674
I erased your data.

00:19:55.757 --> 00:19:57.050
Huh? What'd you say?

00:19:57.134 --> 00:19:58.093
Why?

00:19:58.427 --> 00:20:00.929
Why is a Class S
so happy to see a Class B?

00:20:01.430 --> 00:20:03.223
Master does not
tearm up with others.

00:20:03.724 --> 00:20:05.142
Does not antagonize anyone.

00:20:05.601 --> 00:20:06.935
Ignores rankings.

00:20:07.436 --> 00:20:08.103
My bad.

00:20:08.186 --> 00:20:09.771
Nah, don't worry about it.

00:20:09.938 --> 00:20:11.732
Oh, the button's smooshed in.

00:20:11.815 --> 00:20:13.984
Yet powerful heroes
are drawn to him.

00:20:15.152 --> 00:20:17.112
/f only I were one of them.

00:20:17.613 --> 00:20:18.780
It is because...

00:20:19.865 --> 00:20:21.116
...he Is strong.

00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:38.884
We painted different dreams
into our hearts

00:20:38.967 --> 00:20:43.722
With the struggles that we faced
In the past

00:20:44.264 --> 00:20:49.645
Will the future call
or Will it slip away?

00:20:49.770 --> 00:20:54.650
There's just so much
that we dont know

00:20:54.941 --> 00:21:00.238
But one day, we'll make peace
within ourselves

00:21:00.489 --> 00:21:05.911
Weil be able to forgive
everything in our past

00:21:05.994 --> 00:21:11.083
We tell ourselves to forget,
but nothing seems to fade

00:21:11.166 --> 00:21:15.170
That's what we are to each other

00:21:15.253 --> 00:21:21.593
If you hold out your hand
Youll see the bonds that show us

00:21:21.718 --> 00:21:26.098
That kindness Is the true strength

00:21:26.181 --> 00:21:32.521
Theyre something that I need
To keep on moving on

00:21:32.646 --> 00:21:37.901
So I promise that I'll come back

00:21:38.026 --> 00:21:43.865
I promise that I'll come back to you

00:21:54.960 --> 00:21:59.047
Class S, Rank 14 Genos
and Class B, Rank 7 Saitama.

00:21:59.548 --> 00:22:03.009
We are agreed upon
their hero names?

00:22:03.093 --> 00:22:04.052
— No objections!
— No objections!

00:22:04.302 --> 00:22:08.557
For aggressively attacking numerous
monsters with dauntless courage,

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:11.393
Genos's hero name
will be "Demon Cyborg."

00:22:11.727 --> 00:22:14.187
And based on his appearance,
Saitama's name will be...

00:22:14.312 --> 00:22:15.522
"Caped Baldy."

00:22:15.731 --> 00:22:19.067
A hero name is something
every aspiring hero dreams of.

00:22:19.276 --> 00:22:21.862
No doubt these two will be
overjoyed to hear theirs.

00:22:22.404 --> 00:22:24.281
"Demon Cyborg" and "Caped Baldy."

00:22:24.406 --> 00:22:27.909
They'll work even harder now!

00:22:30.662 --> 00:22:34.082
Two hours of chitchat about
some useless nicknames

00:22:34.249 --> 00:22:37.377
While the meeting to deal
with Garou ends in 15 minutes?

00:22:37.794 --> 00:22:40.255
Damned, good-for-nothing optimists!

00:22:40.672 --> 00:22:43.925
You mean that crazy fellow
who calls himself a monster?

00:22:44.134 --> 00:22:45.594
No need to panic, Sitch.

00:22:46.136 --> 00:22:52.142
Class S, Rank 3 Silverfang
is already in pursuit.

00:22:52.476 --> 00:22:54.144
We can trust that old man.

00:22:54.603 --> 00:22:57.355
If need be, Tornado and Blast
are also available.

00:22:58.106 --> 00:23:00.066
He's just a man, Sitch.

00:23:00.442 --> 00:23:02.652
He likely has nothing to do with
the prophecy.

00:23:03.403 --> 00:23:03.987
Damn!

00:23:04.237 --> 00:23:07.282
Will that really be enough
to deal with Garou?

00:23:09.785 --> 00:23:13.538
What the crap...?
Who the hell are you?!

00:23:14.039 --> 00:23:15.957
I'm a Class A hero!

00:23:16.124 --> 00:23:17.542
Why'd you attack me?

00:23:17.959 --> 00:23:20.504
Class A, Rank 9
Tank-top Vegetarian.

00:23:21.129 --> 00:23:23.298
I happened upon you,
so you're my next prey.

00:23:23.673 --> 00:23:25.926
But I'm stunned by
the lack of challenge.

00:23:26.092 --> 00:23:28.094
Brace yourself then.

00:23:28.762 --> 00:23:31.932
You'll find out what it's like
to throw down with a hero...

00:23:34.309 --> 00:23:36.019
Oh, I'm looking forward to it.

00:23:37.938 --> 00:23:41.733
Whenever I find one who can battle
a monster-class hero.

00:23:45.111 --> 00:23:49.866
THE HUNT BEGINS
